{"sourceUrl":"http://wxy.hnu.edu.cn/info/1041/5669.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:11.115749+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://wxy.hnu.edu.cn/info/1041/5669.htm","html":"<div>\n<p><span><span>一、招生专业</span></span></p>\n<p><span>我院以下专业接收推免生</span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.[050</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>00]</span><span>中国</span></span><span>语言文学（学术学位直博，</span><span>包括应用语言学、比较文学与世界文学</span><span>两</span><span>个二级学科研究方向</span><span>）</span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>[050100]</span><span>中国语言文学（学术</span></span><span>学位</span><span>硕士，包括</span><span>文艺学、</span><span>应用语言学、汉语言文字学、中国古代文学、中国现当代文学、比较文学与世界文学、中国古典文献学</span><span>七</span><span>个二级学科研究方向）</span></p>\n<p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>.[045300]</span><span>国际</span></span><span>中文</span><span>教育，专业</span><span>学位</span><span>硕士</span></p>\n<p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>.[045103]</span><span>教育硕士，学科教学（语文）领域，专业</span></span><span>学位</span><span>硕士</span></p>\n<p><span>具体招生目录</span><span>以教育部推免系统公布的招生专业目录为准。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>二</span></span><span><span>、申请条件</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）拥护中国共产党的领导，遵纪守法，品德良好；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）</span>202</span><span>6</span><span><span>届普通全日制本科毕业生，取得本科所在学校的推荐免试生资格；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（三）研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（四）</span></span><span><span>身体健康状况应符合国家规定的体检要求</span></span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>三</span></span><span><span>、申请程序</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（一）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>预报名</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>2025<span>年</span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span>25</span><span><span>日</span><span>—</span></span><strong><span><span>9</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>12</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>14:00</span></span></strong><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>凡有意报考我院</span></span><span>2026<span>年推荐免试研究生的</span></span><span><span>申请人</span></span><span><span>登录</span></span><span>“</span><a href=\"https://yjszsxt.hnu.edu.cn/zsxt2026/tmsgl/default.aspx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>湖南大学接收推免生报名信息采集系统</span></span></span></a><span>”</span><span><span>进行网上预报名</span></span><span><span>，如实填写各项信息、上传申请材料。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>申请材料</span></span><span><span>包括</span></span><span><span>：</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1.<span>个人简历、身份证和</span></span><span><span>学生证（或学信网学籍在线认证报告）</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2.<span>本科成绩单和总评成绩排名证明</span><span>(</span><span>由教务处盖章或</span></span><span><span>所在</span></span><span><span>学院盖章</span>)<span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3.<span>英语水平证明材料（</span><span>CET-4</span><span>、</span><span>CET-6</span><span>、</span><span>TOEFL</span><span>、</span><span>IELTS</span></span><span><span>等</span></span><span><span>成绩单）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4.<span>学术科研成果（公开发表的论文等）和获奖证书；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>5.<span>参加社会实践、公益事业等的证明材料；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>6.</span><span>其他可反映自身能力和水平的相关材料。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（二）资格审查</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>我院将根据申请人提供的申请材料进行资格审查，择优确定参加复试考核的名单。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>请</span><span>通过我院初审的申请人</span><span>在</span><strong><span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>18</span><span>日（上午</span><span>8:30-11:30</span><span>，下午</span><span>2:30-4:30</span><span>）</span></span></strong><span>携带以</span><span>上</span><span>材料（原件和复印件一份）到湖南大学</span><strong><span><span>中国语言文学学院</span><span>101室</span></span></strong><span>现场确认</span><span>推免生复试</span><span>资格。</span><span>逾期未确认复试资格者视为自动放弃。</span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（三）考核</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1. </span><span><span>考核形式：</span></span><span>采用</span><strong><span>现场</span></strong><strong><span>复试</span></strong><span>方式进行。复试考生按报考专业研究方向分组。</span><span>未在规定时间内参加复试的考试视为自动放弃复试资格。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>第一轮</span></strong><strong><span>复试时间为</span></strong><strong><span>:</span></strong><strong><span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>19</span><span>日</span><span>-20</span><span>日</span></span></strong><span>，</span><span>个人具体复试时间以复试通知为准。</span></p>\n<p><span>2. </span><span><span>考核内容：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>复试主要有外语能力测试、专业素质和能力测试以及综合测试三部分组成，总分值</span><span>100分，每个学生复试时间不少于</span></span><span>20</span><span>分钟。</span></p>\n<p><span>思想政治素质和道德品质考核，不作量化计入复试成绩，考核结果不合格者不予录取。</span></p>\n<p><span>3. </span><span><span>考核成绩：考核满分</span>100<span>分，</span><span>60</span><span>分合格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>四</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>拟</span></span><span><span>录取</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1.</span><span><span>学院按照</span></span><span>“</span><span><span>择优录取、保证质量、宁缺毋滥</span></span><span>”</span><span><span>的原则，根据考核成绩，综合考生思想政治表现、身心健康状况等，在各专业接收推免生计划限额内择优拟录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2.</span><strong><span>2025<span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>22</span><span>日</span></span></strong><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>获得推免生资格且考核合格的申请人</span></span><span><span>在</span></span><span>“</span><span><span>全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开暨管理服务系统</span></span><span>”</span><span><span>（网址：</span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm<span>，以下简称</span></span><span>“</span><span><span>教育部推免服务系统</span></span><span>”</span><span><span>）报名。</span></span><span><span>学院</span></span><span><span>通过教育部推免服务系统向考生发送待录取通知，通知考生进行确认</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>考生收到待录取通知后，按照</span></span><span><span>学院</span></span><span><span>规定时间在教育部推免服务系统确认或拒绝待录取。逾期未确认</span></span><span><span>的</span></span><span><span>考生，视为自动放弃</span></span><span><span>拟</span></span><span><span>录取资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3.<span>针对未进行预报名</span></span><span>但</span><span><span>在教育部推免服务系统报名的考生，学院将根据接收指标剩余情况决定是否发放复试通知和组织复试。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>五</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>联系方式</span></span></p>\n<p><span>（一）学院联系人：</span><span>张</span><span>老师；联系电话：</span><span><span>0731-88821384</span></span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）确定参加学院推免复试的同学请加入湖南大学文学院</span><span>202</span></span><span>6</span><span>年推免生</span><span>复试</span><span>群（</span><strong><span>QQ群号: </span></strong><strong><span><span>9</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>46639313</span></span></strong><span><span>），学院推免工作的信息通过群消息发放。申请加群时请按照本格式：湖南大学研究生管理系统报名编号</span><span>+姓名+本科学校名称，方可确保加群申请通过。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>六、</span><span><span>其他</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1.<span>对学术不端及弄虚作假者，不论何时，一经查实，即按相关规定取消报考资格、录取资格或取消学籍。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2.<span>学校将对新生入学资格进行复查，推免生如在录取当年入学时未取得国家承认的本科毕业证书，录取资格无效。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3.<span>根据教育部政策规定，取得录取资格的推免生不得再报名参加当年硕士研究生招生考试，否则取消其推免录取资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4.<span>其他未尽事宜，按照湖南大学招生相关文件及我院补充通知执行。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>湖南大学</span></span><span>中国语言文学</span><span><span>学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2025<span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span></span></span><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span><span></span></span><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div>","textSha256":"cb980ebc810a27b400a8e0fc3a3460c536cbf35306f0b110b59fa2fc1b53edea","textLength":1700,"sourceSha256":"30ffe5f5e3c5f39d153c43116f34ea7c69e31bec24564ddb8d86da915dbee5e7","selector":".v_news_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-9cd55d74810f814c1d23","title":"2025年湖南大学中国语言文学学院2026年招收推荐免试攻读研究生（含直博生）复试录取工作实施细则","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:11.115749+00:00"}
